  "title": "How to Test Your Game or App with AI Agents: A Complete Guide to Automated QA",
  "summary": "AI QA testing with nunu works like this: you describe a test in plain English (\"complete the tutorial,\" \"complete the signup flow and verify the confirmation email screen appears\"), and an AI agent executes it on a real device by looking at the screen and interacting like a human user. No test scripts, no engine integration, no SDK required to start.",
